00:04:12.752 --> 00:04:15.046 position:61%
Yeah, I would try to lean forward like,
just like me.

00:04:15.046 --> 00:04:16.506
Like, lean into it a little bit.

00:04:16.631 --> 00:04:20.718
There you go.

00:04:20.718 --> 00:04:21.135
Okay.

00:04:21.135 --> 00:04:22.804 position:63%
And again,
target's, like, less than ten feet away,

00:04:22.804 --> 00:04:24.722
